<title>USA: Optical Sensors sees Q4 order momentum.</title>
<headline>Optical Sensors sees Q4 order momentum.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical Sensors Inc said it expects order flow for its SensiCath Sensor to gain momentum in the fourth quarter after its marketing partner, Marquette Medical Systems Inc releases a related software package.</p>
<p>Optical also said it received regulatory clearance on September 2 for marketing the SensiCath Sensor in the Netherlands.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
